<div class="mandarin-hanzi">家</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">jiā</div>

''Meaning:'' home; family; classifier for businesses/institutions  
''Part of speech:'' noun; measure word

!! In context
她今天在家。 — Tā jīntiān zài jiā. — She is at home today.

!! Usage note
A noun meaning 'home' or 'family', and also a classifier for establishments. Compare 这是一家饭店 (Zhè shì yì jiā fàndiàn, 'This is a restaurant').
